  <h3>How do you give a design/code review</h3>
  <p>
    you go through there code and look at there site. also use a validator to
    check the HTML. Then make an issue on the repository in a checklist of
    things they should change.
  </p>
  <h3>How do you document you progress?</h3>
  <p>
    Go to the dlo website and post evidence there as plaint text. Give a
    description and what went well and what could go better next time. Also make
    sure you link to evidence, so the github issues or the github commits or
    directly some piece of code
  </p>
  <h3>How do you make the HTML element always fit the screen?</h3>
  <p>Use height: fit-content</p>
